
       IDENTIFICATION   DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.      prog.
       DATA DIVISION.
       PROCEDURE        DIVISION.
           CALL 'module'
           CALL 'modulepart'
           STOP RUN.


       IDENTIFICATION   DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.      module.
       DATA DIVISION.
       PROCEDURE        DIVISION.
           DISPLAY 'A' WITH NO ADVANCING
           GOBACK.
       ENTRY 'modulepart'.
           DISPLAY 'B' WITH NO ADVANCING
           GOBACK.